OL,3,GNEWSABereaved friends launch hospice
OL,4,Afootball fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was quite lovely to know how much
OL,7,Fof a family club they really are."
OL,9,FSam Rogers' dad Duncan was receiving
OL,10,Fend-of-life care from Thames Hospice
OL,11,Fwhen Reading FC captain Lewis Wing came
OL,12,Fto visit.
OL,14,FHis dad was bedbound for two months,
OL,15,Fand Lewis spent 45 minutes chatting
OL,16,Fwith him at his bedside.
